# PDA mode on the FZ-M1 tablet turned to portrait (report 043, docs/PDA-PROFILE.md "Large screens: the tablet"):
# 800x1280 on the profile pda with the tablet's board name and panel size (rotate 90, 150x93 mm). The band's writing
# area is one third of the height (427 px) with the 51 px key strip on top; the page keeps the rest. Shots for the
# documentation: the home grid (no text field, no band), Settings > System > Keyboard test with the band under its
# Text field (the terminal: pda_tablet_terminal). Review only (no golden); the PDA mode settings
# shots come from the pda_mode scene.
title pda tablet
sizes 800x1280
review
profile pda
env APPLAUNCH_BOARD pc-fzm1-2
env APPLAUNCH_PANEL_MM 150x93
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 1
apps Settings CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=fixture:ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=fixture:store_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png" "Serial Console=cli_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_zone hidden
shot tablet_home
launch Settings
key UP
key ENTER
key UP
key UP
key UP
key ENTER
expect_zone shown
shot tablet_band_text
